{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/1ba813e028b5672514dd038ea2dff64c.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/1ba813e028b5672514dd038ea2dff64c.webp?t=1775662653 width=1560 height=298 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dystopia Punk</i></strong> is a co-op cyberpunk action game where you and your crew take on high-risk operations in a city ruled by ruthless corporations and warring factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into hostile districts, complete your objectives, and extract before the system crushes you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is a shared story:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clean infiltration that spirals into chaos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A last-second extraction under heavy fire</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crew barely making it out alive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city doesn\u2019t reset.<br> It reacts. It retaliates. It remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job shifts the balance of power in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan the run. Trust your crew. Get out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/a4ae616e8bb16f78871127e3baf4d57c.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/a4ae616e8bb16f78871127e3baf4d57c.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/a4ae616e8bb16f78871127e3baf4d57c.mp4?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/b170e07750e32b893c796691a2848ddb.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/b170e07750e32b893c796691a2848ddb.webp?t=1775662653 width=1560 height=298 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a shared operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into a district, complete your objectives, and extract before the situation spirals out of control.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objectives vary</strong> - sabotage, theft, control, extraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple approaches</strong> - stealth, hacking, or full assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic encounters</strong> - patrols, reinforcements, unexpected threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction is never guaranteed</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay longer, earn more - but risk everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No plan survives contact with the city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/738f5afff09eaddb0eb5e45544f53b63.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/738f5afff09eaddb0eb5e45544f53b63.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/738f5afff09eaddb0eb5e45544f53b63.mp4?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/959d909f0adffd3de148b336cd31c832.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/959d909f0adffd3de148b336cd31c832.avif?t=1775662653 width=800 height=153 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a static map.<br> The city responds to what players do inside it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrols increase in contested zones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints tighten after repeated strikes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions shift presence and behavior</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Districts evolve as pressure builds</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too hard in one place, and the system pushes back harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/3f2df95ff15be444c9b8c7c4065118ad.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/3f2df95ff15be444c9b8c7c4065118ad.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/3f2df95ff15be444c9b8c7c4065118ad.mp4?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/040d985a5e56c1e440b457d6a1575ea0.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/040d985a5e56c1e440b457d6a1575ea0.webp?t=1775662653 width=1560 height=298 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t just skill - it\u2019s who you bring with you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit characters with different strengths and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine combat, hacking, and support organically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade cybernetics, gear, and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look, loadout, and identity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fixed roles. No perfect builds.<br> Just what works for your team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/58ff3f33811a78249216fe1c4a7d9e11.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/58ff3f33811a78249216fe1c4a7d9e11.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/3383394e27dc1ce9c32eb3c20a3043ae.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/3383394e27dc1ce9c32eb3c20a3043ae.webp?t=1775662653 width=1560 height=298 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the only crew out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every operation contributes to a wider struggle playing out across the city - even if you never see the full picture.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Districts shift in control over time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions gain or lose influence</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Opportunities open - and close - based on pressure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple routes, hidden paths, and layered environments</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job leaves a mark - whether you see it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t control the war.<br> But you\u2019re in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.mp4?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is a battlefield, and only the bold will survive. Take on the Megacorps, outmaneuver their enforcers, and turn the tide in favor of the rebellion. <strong>Every mission matters. Every choice shapes the war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to reclaim the street?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Take Back Your Future!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1352840?t=1775662653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/ea71f38ab0363f30473041b5bc2c9190b01e0aef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775662653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/3e28793c58067a0eac98214f3243b626d511342d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775662653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/3e28793c58067a0eac98214f3243b626d511342d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775662653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Dystopia Punk contains strong language, intense violence, blood and gore, as well as nudity and sexual material."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/1ba813e028b5672514dd038ea2dff64c.avif?t=1775662653\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras_big/1ba813e028b5672514dd038ea2dff64c.webp?t=1775662653 width=1560 height=298 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dystopia Punk</i></strong> is a co-op cyberpunk action game where you and your crew take on high-risk operations in a city ruled by ruthless corporations and warring factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into hostile districts, complete your objectives, and extract before the system crushes you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is a shared story:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clean infiltration that spirals into chaos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A last-second extraction under heavy fire</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crew barely making it out alive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city doesn\u2019t reset.<br> It reacts. It retaliates. It remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job shifts the balance of power in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan the run. Trust your crew. Get out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/a4ae616e8bb16f78871127e3baf4d57c.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><sourc