ass=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Districts shift in control over time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions gain or lose influence</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Opportunities open - and close - based on pressure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple routes, hidden paths, and layered environments</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job leaves a mark - whether you see it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t control the war.<br> But you\u2019re in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.poster.avif?t=1775662653\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.webm?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/extras/fe0e76144ffcee69a1b692f459c9056e.mp4?t=1775662653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is a battlefield, and only the bold will survive. Take on the Megacorps, outmaneuver their enforcers, and turn the tide in favor of the rebellion. <strong>Every mission matters. Every choice shapes the war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to reclaim the street?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Take Back Your Future!</strong></h2>","developers":["Megacrush Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352840/98895ef2974eb3484d07e533612c934698e60dfc/header